Hi <%= @order.customer.name %>,

Thank you for shopping with <%= @order.store.name %>! 🎉
We’re excited to let you know that your order has been received and is now being processed.

🛒 **Order Details**
- **Order ID:** <%= @order.id %>
- **Order Total:** <%= number_to_currency(@order.total_price,
                                          unit: "₹",
                                          format: "%u%n",
                                          delimiter: ",",
                                          precision: 2
                       ) %>

📦 **Items in your order:**
<% @order.order_items.each do |oi| %>
  - <%= oi.product.name %> × <%= oi.quantity %> — <%= number_to_currency(oi.price,
                                                                         unit: "₹",
                                                                         format: "%u%n",
                                                                         delimiter: ",",
                                                                         precision: 2
                                                      ) %>
<% end %>

If you have any questions, feel free to reply to this email.

Thanks again for choosing <%= @order.store.name %>!
We look forward to serving you again.

Warm regards,
**The <%= @order.store.name %> Team**